WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
<v Host>Good morning, and welcome to the
weekly planning meeting.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.060
<v Host>Today we need to decide on the launch
date for the new mobile app.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.940
<v QA Lead>Thanks. I reviewed the
test results yesterday.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:17.240
<v QA Lead>The crash rate dropped to under 1%,
so I think we are nearly ready.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:23.700
<v Host>That is great news. What about the
translation work for the Spanish and French

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.080
<v Host>versions?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.160
<v QA Lead>The Spanish strings are finished. French
should be done by Thursday, assuming the

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.680
<v QA Lead>agency delivers on time.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.440
<v Host>Perfect. Then let's aim for a launch on the
15th of next month and review progress

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.380
<v Host>again on Friday.
